{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"65f3df81-b13d-47cb-b888-1819de66dd2a","status":"SUCCESS","response":"The project has been upgraded to the current Pollar SDK (`0.12.0`), which targets the `/v3` API and replaces the deprecated `0.10.x` API.\n\n### Summary of Changes\n\n1. **Dependencies ([`package.json`](file:///tmp/h-iyWmSx/package.json) \u0026 [`package-lock.json`](file:///tmp/h-iyWmSx/package-lock.json))**:\n   - Upgraded `@pollar/core` and `@pollar/react` from `^0.10.1` to `^0.12.0`.\n\n2. **Base API URL ([`src/pollar.ts`](file:///tmp/h-iyWmSx/src/pollar.ts))**:\n   - Updated `baseUrl` from `'https://sdk.api.pollar.xyz/v1'` to `'https://sdk.api.pollar.xyz'`. The 0.12.x SDK appends `/v3` internally.\n\n3. **Balances ([`src/balances.ts`](file:///tmp/h-iyWmSx/src/balances.ts))**:\n   - Handled nullable balance values (`string | null`) introduced in modern Pollar multichain balance records.\n\n4. **KYC Statuses ([`src/kyc.ts`](file:///tmp/h-iyWmSx/src/kyc.ts))**:\n   - Added handling for the `'expired'` state in `KycStatus`.\n\n5. **Trustline Sponsorship ([`src/trust.ts`](file:///tmp/h-iyWmSx/src/trust.ts))**:\n   - Removed the obsolete `{ sponsored: true }` parameter from `client.setTrustline(USDC)` (trustlines are sponsored by default unless `skipSponsorship: true` is passed).\n\n6. **Ramps \u0026 Rate Quoting ([`src/ramp.ts`](file:///tmp/h-iyWmSx/src/ramp.ts))**:\n   - Replaced deprecated `client.getRampsQuote()` with `client.getRampRoutes('ONRAMP')` and `client.quoteRamp()`. Calculated the ARS/USDC exchange rate (`amountIn / amountOut`) for the top-up quote.\n\n7. **Documentation**:\n   - Documented the changes in detail in [`ANSWER.md`](file:///tmp/h-iyWmSx/ANSWER.md).\n\n### Verification\n- Tested with `npx tsc --noEmit` and `npm run typecheck`, both passing cleanly without errors.\n","duration_seconds":543.024946,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":464118,"output_tokens":10690,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":7385524,"total_tokens":474808}}}
